@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam nodesep 30

[SpecificationManual.xml\ncodigo 000.010.000.030\ncampo "Sexo", tabla CVN_SEX_A] as manual
[CVNTreeModel.xml\nruta: Identification /\nPersonalIdentification / Gender] as tree
[Metadatos normalizados\npor codigo CVN] as normalized
[ReferenceTables.xml\nCVN_SEX_A: 2 valores\n(Hombre, Mujer)] as reftable
[Resolucion de referencias +\npolitica semantica\nenum compacto, elegible] as policy
[Open CVN JSON Schema\nidentity.person.sexo ->\nvocabularies.cvn_sex_a] as schema

manual --> normalized
tree --> normalized
normalized --> policy
reftable --> policy : evidencia de tabla
policy --> schema

note right of schema
Cada definicion conserva trazas
x-open-cvn-code, x-open-cvn-source-reference
y x-open-cvn-xml-paths.
end note
@enduml
